  "title": "CCP Boeing OFT Rollout for Wet Dress Rehearsal",
  "description": "A United Launch Alliance Atlas V rocket, topped by the Boeing CST-100 Starliner spacecraft, rolled out to the launch pad from the Vertical Integration Facility at Space Launch Complex 41 at Florida's Cape Canaveral Air Force Station on Dec. 4, 2019. The vehicle was in place for Boeing's wet dress rehearsal ahead of the upcoming Orbital Flight Test, an uncrewed mission to the International Space Station for NASA's Commercial Crew Program.",
